OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CGig evacuation quarantine was          
OL,5,Ctraumatic, fans say                    
OL,6,GSome Don Toliver fans who were         
OL,7,Gevacuated from Manchester's Co-op Live 
OL,8,Garena after an unknown substance was   
OL,9,Greleased have said they were           
OL,10,G"quarantined for six hours" and        
OL,11,Gthreatened with arrest if they did not 
OL,12,Gremove all their clothing.             
OL,14,FJordan, 33, from Scotland, said he and 
OL,15,Fhis brothers were among 88 people who  
OL,16,Fwere taken for decontamination after   
OL,17,Fthe incident at the gig on Sunday      
OL,18,Fnight, and it "felt like I was being   
OL,19,Ftaken hostage".                        
